      <h3>Three delayed checks</h3>
      <div class="quiz-list">
        <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="Please turn it on." data-hint="The pronoun it belongs between the separable verb and particle." data-fix="Please turn it on."><p class="quiz-question">1. The laptop is off, and <span class="ex">it</span> replaces the noun. Which instruction is accurate?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Please turn it on.">Please turn it on.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Please turn on it.">Please turn on it.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Please it turn on.">Please it turn on.</button></div></div>
